        "heading": "What a resin statue is",
        "body": "<p>These are display pieces cast in resin, finished and painted by hand, and made in limited runs rather than mass production. That is why two examples of the same statue can differ slightly, and why they are heavier than they look.</p><p>Resin chips rather than flexes, so treat one like a ceramic vase that happens to be shaped like a pirate. The larger pieces want two people and a surface you are not planning to move again.</p><p>Everything here is pre-owned. Each listing shows photographs of the actual piece you will receive, with its condition described as we find it, and its original packaging where that is included.</p>"
